  "endonym": [{ "value": "Oumara", "gloss": "the water that comes back" }],
  "catalogueCode": "HB-1/007-b",
  "description": [
    {
      "value": "<p>A locked ocean world with a warm pool under the primary, an ice cap on the far side, and between them a tidal range that the secondary star drags up to nearly thirty metres. Twice a cycle the flats between the archipelagos drain to the horizon and then fill again in under four hours. All the settled ground is coastal and all of it is built to be flooded. First landing 2263; no visit has yet managed a complete tidal year in one stay.</p>",
      "inLanguage": [{ "id": ["core.peerdb.org", "LANGUAGE", "en-GB"] }]
    },
    {
      "value": "<p>Oceanski svet z ogromnim plimskim razponom; vsa naselja so obalna in zgrajena za poplave.</p>",
      "inLanguage": [{ "id": ["core.peerdb.org", "LANGUAGE", "sl-SI"] }]
    }
  ],
